{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093232-the-dreams-rekindled","id":1093232,"title":"The Dreams Rekindled","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-16T07:20:53-07:00","id":1093232,"title":"The Dreams Rekindled","content":"So I'm not sure if we can talk about this sort of thing here (and happy to take it elsewhere if not) but I remember once-upon-a-time there were a great many home-brew projects going on to expand the Dreaming. Fan-made books on strange kith and distant lands. I myself was (now am) working on a book for the Kingdoms of the Feathered Serpent, Modern Dreams, and Beast Fae. <br /> <br /> What I am wondering is if anyone else has felt the warmth of the balefire rekindle their creative spirit, and is revisiting old projects like these...and if so, what wondrous new dreams may be appearing for the fandom?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3959-urabyfirst","name":"Urabyfirst","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T11:07:17-07:00","id":1093342,"title":"","content":"Those sound interesting, I really wanted to bring more asian and oceanic fey to the game. Possibly a spin on what the local concepts of the Enchanted and Kinian would be. For example I had played in a game once where there was a 'Magical Girl' Kinian.<br /> <br /> Cant wait to read c20 I have so much work to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T08:36:26-07:00","id":1094152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Urabyfirst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093232-the-dreams-rekindled#post1093232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm not sure if we can talk about this sort of thing here (and happy to take it elsewhere if not) but I remember once-upon-a-time there were a great many home-brew projects going on to expand the Dreaming. Fan-made books on strange kith and distant lands. I myself was (now am) working on a book for the Kingdoms of the Feathered Serpent, Modern Dreams, and Beast Fae.<br /> <br /> What I am wondering is if anyone else has felt the warmth of the balefire rekindle their creative spirit, and is revisiting old projects like these...and if so, what wondrous new dreams may be appearing for the fandom?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Urabyfirst, That sounds rather awesome!!!<br /> I live in the Kingdom of the Feathered Serpent, currently on the Duchy of the Everchanging Skies (Queretaro), but I used to live on the City of Palaces (Mexico city... and yes, I know even mortals use that name for the city, but it sounds so Changeling-appropriate!), so i'd be very interested in seeing what you come up with, or even help if help's required.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10198-luisarmander","name":"Luisarmander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T06:37:26-07:00","id":1094514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luisarmander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1093232-the-dreams-rekindled?p=1094152#post1094152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Urabyfirst, That sounds rather awesome!!!<br /> I live in the Kingdom of the Feathered Serpent, currently on the Duchy of the Everchanging Skies (Queretaro), but I used to live on the City of Palaces (Mexico city... and yes, I know even mortals use that name for the city, but it sounds so Changeling-appropriate!), so i'd be very interested in seeing what you come up with, or even help if help's required.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've sent you a PM about it. I'd be more than happy to share what I have written so far!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3959-urabyfirst","name":"Urabyfirst","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}